# BuildKit: web.Dockerfile uchun alohida ignore fayli (Dockerfile nomi + ".dockerignore").
# Build konteksti: /opt/yuksalish (uchala repo ning ota papkasi), shuning uchun yo'llar shu papkaga nisbatan.
# Keraksiz va maxfiy fayllar build kontekstiga tushmasin.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Backend kodi bu image ga kerak emas (api alohida build qilinadi), faqat Caddyfile kerak
Yuksalish_backend/*
!Yuksalish_backend/deploy
Yuksalish_backend/deploy/*
!Yuksalish_backend/deploy/Caddyfile

# Hujjatlar
**/docs
**/*.md
